{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-p086b","title":"梁鹄窃取师宜官书札学书","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-p086b-account","label":"卫恒《四体书势序》","text":"师宜官书后常毁札，梁鹄供书版并请其饮酒，趁醉取札，后来以书艺任选部尚书。","evidence":["wudi-e-p086b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0258","role":"学书受官","evidence":["wudi-e-p086b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0257","role":"书札被取","evidence":["wudi-e-p086b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"灵帝好书的叙事背景","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据所在段落机械补定年份。","evidence":["wudi-e-p086b-q"]},"source_order":[1,688,"P086b"],"order":281},{"id":"wudi-e-p086c","title":"梁鹄任曹操为洛阳北部尉","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-p086c-account","label":"卫恒《四体书势序》","text":"曹操想任洛阳令，梁鹄以其为北部尉；梁鹄后来依附刘表。","evidence":["wudi-e-p086c-q"]},{"id":"wudi-e-p132a-account","label":"《四体书势序》","text":"《四体书势序》记梁鹄以曹操为北部尉。","evidence":["wudi-e-p132a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0258","role":"选官后依刘表","evidence":["wudi-e-p086c-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"受任","evidence":["wudi-e-p086c-q"]},{"person":"liu-biao","role":"被依附","evidence":["wudi-e-p086c-q"]}],"place":{"text":"洛阳","evidence":["wudi-e-p086c-q"]},"time":{"label":"原文未明示时间","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据所在段落机械补定年份。","evidence":["wudi-e-p086c-q"]},"source_order":[1,688,"P086c"],"order":282},{"id":"wudi-e-p086d","title":"曹操获梁鹄任其书写","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-p086d-account","label":"卫恒《四体书势序》","text":"荆州平后曹操寻访梁鹄，梁鹄自缚来见，受署军假司马在秘书供职；曹操喜爱其书。","evidence":["wudi-e-p086d-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"寻访任用","evidence":["wudi-e-p086d-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0258","role":"归附任职","evidence":["wudi-e-p086d-q"]}],"place":{"text":"荆州","evidence":["wudi-e-p086d-q"]},"time":{"label":"荆州平后","year":208,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-p086d-q","wudi-q-o119","wudi-q-b-888495d8be7766faf20c"],"chronology":"wudi-y208","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o119","basis":"荆州平后","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,688,"P086d"],"order":283}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0258","name":"梁鹄","evidence":["wudi-q-p086","wangwei-q-6c398c47ef99cdf68974"],"facts":[{"id":"wudi-f-p086-wudi-p0258-c55038","label":"字","text":"孟黄","evidence":["wudi-f-p086-wudi-p0258-c55038-q"]},{"id":"wudi-f-p086-wudi-p0258-3d9187","label":"籍贯","text":"安定","evidence":["wudi-f-p086-wudi-p0258-3d9187-q"]},{"id":"wudi-f-p086-wudi-p0258-f13965","label":"书艺记载","text":"魏宫殿题署皆为梁鹄所书","evidence":["wudi-f-p086-wudi-p0258-f13965-q"]},{"id":"wangwei-f-ef9d261f0a751413f997","text":"《四体书势》述其评邯郸淳得次仲法。","evidence":["wangwei-q-6c398c47ef99cdf68974"]}],"aliases":[{"text":"孟黄","evidence":["wudi-f-p086-wudi-p0258-c55038-q"]}],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-p086-wudi-p0258","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-p086"]},{"id":"wudi-m-p132-wudi-p0258","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-p132"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wangwei-q-6c398c47ef99cdf68974","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-cd77d33f69889e930350","layer":"pei","quote":"其序录隶书，已略见《武纪》，又曰：“师宜官为大字，邯郸淳为小字。梁鹄谓淳得次仲法，然鹄之用笔，尽其势矣。”","attribution":"裴注引卫恒《四体书势》","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":415,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-9886d275cee1012511a7","start":0,"end":53,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p086b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-648d7c68dbec5a605916","layer":"pei","quote":"至灵帝好书，世多能者，而师宜官为最。甚矜其能，每书，辄削焚其札。梁鹄乃益为版而饮之酒，候其醉而窃其札。鹄卒以攻书至选部尚书。","attribution":"卫恒《四体书势序》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":12,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-cf8a0075075368325cde","start":30,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p086c-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-648d7c68dbec5a605916","layer":"pei","quote":"于是公欲为洛阳令，鹄以为北部尉。鹄后依刘表。","attribution":"卫恒《四体书势序》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":12,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-cf8a0075075368325cde","start":92,"end":114,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p086d-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-648d7c68dbec5a605916","layer":"pei","quote":"及荆州平，公募求鹄；鹄惧，自缚诣门。署军假司马，使在秘书，以勤书自效。公常悬著帐中，及以钉壁玩之，谓胜宜官。","attribution":"卫恒《四体书势序》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":12,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-cf8a0075075368325cde","start":114,"end":168,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p132a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-5b89bde2dd47c752972d","layer":"pei","quote":"《四体书势序》曰：“梁鹄以公为北部尉。”","attribution":"《四体书势序》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":374,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fdb966d8839f43c95d67","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-f-p086-wudi-p0258-3d9187-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-648d7c68dbec5a605916","layer":"pei","quote":"鹄字孟黄，安定人。","attribution":"卫恒《四体书势序》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":12,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-cf8a0075075368325cde","start":168,"end":177,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-f-p086-wudi-p0258-c55038-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-648d7c68dbec5a605916","layer":"pei","quote":"鹄字孟黄，安定人。","attribution":"卫恒《四体书势序》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":12,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-cf8a0075075368325cde","start":168,"end":177,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-f-p086-wudi-p0258-f13965-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-648d7c68dbec5a605916","layer":"pei","quote":"魏宫殿题署，皆鹄书也。","attribution":"卫恒《四体书势序》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":12,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-cf8a0075075368325cde","start":177,"end":188,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-888495d8be7766faf20c","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-888495d8be7766faf20c","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十三年：建安十三年（公元 208）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":666,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0bae348fdb687025113d","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o119","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4bcffcc4ee709a4e5ea3","layer":"original","quote":"十三年春正月〖1〗，公还邺。作玄武池以肄舟师〖2〗。﹝一﹞汉罢三公官，置丞相、御史大夫〖3〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":661,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p086","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-648d7c68dbec5a605916","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞卫恒《四体书势序》曰：“上谷王次仲，善隶书，始为楷法。至灵帝好书，世多能者，而师宜官为最。甚矜其能，每书，辄削焚其札。梁鹄乃益为版而饮之酒，候其醉而窃其札。鹄卒以攻书至选部尚书。于是公欲为洛阳令，鹄以为北部尉。鹄后依刘表。及荆州平，公募求鹄；鹄惧，自缚诣门。署军假司马，使在秘书，以勤书自效。公常悬著帐中，及以钉壁玩之，谓胜宜官。鹄字孟黄，安定人。魏宫殿题署，皆鹄书也。”","attribution":"卫恒《四体书势序》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":12,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-cf8a0075075368325cde","start":0,"end":189,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p132","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-5b89bde2dd47c752972d","layer":"pei","quote":"《四体书势序》曰：“梁鹄以公为北部尉。”","attribution":"《四体书势序》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":374,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fdb966d8839f43c95d67","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
